<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 2.0 bln in 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 2.0 bln in 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office invited bids on Wednesday for an auction of 2.0 billion crowns of ten-year bonds.</p>
<p>Bids have to be entered by 1030 GMT on July 2.</p>
<p>						Loan 1037</p>
<p> Auction date			     July 2, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date			    Aug 15, 2007</p>
<p> Coupon  (pct)			    8.00</p>
<p> Amount to the market (billions)    2.0</p>
<p> Settlement date			  July 7, 1997</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
